 occurrence of these events, if not fully covered by insurance, could have a material effect on our financial condition, results of operations and cash flows as well as potential reputational impact.","block":354,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000072903-26-000009","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-25","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0000072903","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/72903/000007290326000009/xel-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558.bin","sha256":"15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558"}},{"id":"6ca6b1cd9758f7ca73d5cb50c87f0a92fc52f761c7014da550e93aaefa92d276","quote":"•Risks associated with increased reliance on natural gas generation, including gas price volatility and supply constraints during extreme weather events.","context":"•Risks associated with dependence on a specific type of fuel or fuel source, such as commodity price risk, availability of adequate fuel supply and transportation and lack of available alternative fuel sources.","section":"The occurrence of these events, if not fully covered by insurance, could have a material effect on our financial condition, results of operations and cash flows as well as potential reputational impact.","block":355,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000072903-26-000009","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-25","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0000072903","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/72903/000007290326000009/xel-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558.bin","sha256":"15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558"}},{"id":"f00e643cb9dfa871b0b6b514b4b8cc6ee264f10ebc4ce4b93081b1783b9b6ee3","quote":"•Increased competition due to, among other factors, new facilities, excess supply, shifting demand and regulatory changes.","context":"•Risks associated with increased reliance on natural gas generation, including gas price volatility and supply constraints during extreme weather events.","section":"The occurrence of these events, if not fully covered by insurance, could have a material effect on our financial condition, results of operations and cash flows as well as potential reputational impact.","block":356,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000072903-26-000009","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-25","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0000072903","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/72903/000007290326000009/xel-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558.bin","sha256":"15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558"}},{"id":"4c39dd5868c78c58d97bbfc3ddb27af9dcaaae6b27bd4d30047846541f191d08","quote":"•Risks of thermal runaway incidents associated with large battery storage facilities","context":"•Increased competition due to, among other factors, new facilities, excess supply, shifting demand and regulatory changes.","section":"The occurrence of these events, if not fully covered by insurance, could have a material effect on our financial condition, results of operations and cash flows as well as potential reputational impact.","block":357,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000072903-26-000009","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-25","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0000072903","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/72903/000007290326000009/xel-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558.bin","sha256":"15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558"}},{"id":"ce621b57fcc31e9d93e06e8d