events, if not fully covered by insurance, could have a material effect on our financial condition, results of operations and cash flows as well as potential reputational impact.","block":392,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000072903-26-000009","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-25","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0000072903","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/72903/000007290326000009/xel-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558.bin","sha256":"15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558"}},{"id":"6c06f170e1665f683e6c7265b159cb781dd906a417401a26c74ade8ae63f7aca","quote":"Failure to hire, adequately train replacement employees, transfer knowledge/expertise or future availability and cost of contract labor may adversely affect the ability to manage and operate our business. Inability to attract and retain these employees could adversely impact our results of operations, financial condition or cash flows.","context":"The competition for talent has become increasingly prevalent, and we have experienced increased employee turnover due to the condition of the labor market and decisions related to strategic workforce planning. In addition, specialized knowledge and skills are required for many of our positions, which may pose additional difficulty for us as we work to recruit, retain and motivate employees in this climate.","section":"The occurrence of these events, if not fully covered by insurance, could have a material effect on our financial condition, results of operations and cash flows as well as potential reputational impact.","block":393,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000072903-26-000009","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-25","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0000072903","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/72903/000007290326000009/xel-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558.bin","sha256":"15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558"}},{"id":"c062d6c58fce3f5eeb90e5892563d4f326ea3278584e147ceaacdf95d5bb4915","quote":"Our businesses have collective bargaining agreements with labor unions. Failure to renew or renegotiate these contracts could lead to labor disruptions, including strikes or boycotts. Such disruptions or any negotiated wage or benefit increases could have a material adverse impact to our results of operations, financial condition or cash flows.","context":"Failure to hire, adequately train replacement employees, transfer knowledge/expertise or future availability and cost of contract labor may adversely affect the ability to manage and operate our business. Inability to attract and retain these employees could adversely impact our results of operations, financial condition or cash flows.","section":"The occurrence of these events, if not fully covered by insurance, could have a material effect on our financial condition, results of operations and cash flows as well as potential reputational impact.","block":394,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000072903-26-000009","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-25","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0000072903","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/72903/000007290326000009/xel-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558.bin","sha256":"15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558"}},{"id":"d4132ea5bd8c2cd50300444e6ab528075d037dbf749327fb7ba8d4be6bc27421","quote":"National unionization efforts could affect our business, as an increase in unionized workers could challenge our operational efficiency and increase costs.","context":"Our businesses have collective bargaining agreements with labor unions. Failure to renew or renegotiate these contracts could lead to labor disruptions, including strikes or boycotts. Such disruptions or any negotiated wage or benefit increases could have a material adverse impact to our results of operations, financial condition or cash flows.","section":"The occurrence of these events, if not fully covered by insurance, could have a material effect on our financial condition, results of operations and cash flows as well as potential reputational impact.","block":395,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000072903-26-000009","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-25","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0000072903","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/72903/000007290326000009/xel-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558.bin","sha256":"15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558"}},{"id":"829e35be5118c68550c09160b409dee2608b2a9a837e00a2ef2dbcf0f43fd143","quote":"Our operations use third-party contractors in addition to employees to perform periodic and ongoing work.","context":"National unionization efforts could affect our business, as an increase in unionized workers could challenge our operational efficiency and increase costs.","section":"The occurrence of these events, if not fully covered by insurance, could have a material effect on our financial condition, results of operations and cash flows as well as potential reputational impact.","block":396,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000072903-26-000009","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-25","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0000072903","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/72903/000007290326000009/xel-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558.bin","sha256":"15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558"}},{"id":"3ab93c2020a2b54721ff4c24cc72ae9f3bccecea72d7d34f660fcba59a478213","quote":"We rely on third-party contractors to perform operations, maintenance and construction work. Poor vendor performance or contractor unavailability could impact ongoing operations, restoration operations, regulatory recovery and our reputation and could introduce financial risk or risks of fines. Also, suppliers of key assets critical to long-term planning may be limited, creating vendor concentration risk that could increase costs and negatively impact investment execution.","context":"Our operations use third-party contractors in addition to employees to perform periodic and ongoing work.","section":"The occurrence of these events, if not fully covered by insurance, could have a material effect on our financial condition, results of operations and cash flows as well as potential reputational impact.","block":397,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000072903-26-000009","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-25","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0000072903","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/72903/000007290326000009/xel-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558.bin","sha256":"15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558"}},{"id":"1b6a67d905d3e67309eab75a78c3f3bf302b7c6b24766594d4c8bc077f2b2c1d","quote":"Actions of our employees, directors, third-party contractors or suppliers could expose us to reputational risks.","context":"We rely on third-party contractors to perform operations, maintenance and construction work. Poor vendor performance or contractor unavailability could impact ongoing operations, restoration operations, regulatory recovery and our reputation and could introduce financial risk or risks of fines. Also, suppliers of key assets critical to long-term planning may be limited, creating vendor concentration risk that could increase costs and negatively impact investment execution.","section":"The occurrence of these events, if not fully covered by insurance, could have a material effect on our financial condition, results of operations and cash flows as well as potential reputational impact.","block":398,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000072903-26-000009","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-25","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0000072903","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/72903/000007290326000009/xel-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558.bin","sha256":"15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558"}},{"id":"9a740adf96926b3e6dbce78835820f960053ed5787ae7a1bc3f02fbc77600d22","quote":"We could suffer negative impacts to our reputation as a result of actual or perceived fraud, misconduct, legal or regulatory violations, violations of corporate policies, inappropriate use of social media, or other actions by our employees, directors, third-party contractors or suppliers. Reputational damage could have a material adverse effect and could result in negative customer perception, litigation and increased regulatory oversight.","context":"Actions of our employees, directors, third-party contractors or suppliers could expose us to reputational risks.","section":"The occurrence of these events, if not fully covered by insurance, could have a material effect on our financial condition, results of operations and cash flows as well as potential reputational impact.","block":399,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000072903-26-000009","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-25","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0000072903","