908","quote":"Xcel Energy maintains a set of disclosure controls and procedures designed to ensure that information required to be disclosed in reports that it files or submits under the Securities Exchange Act of 1934 is recorded, processed, summarized, and reported within the time periods specified in SEC rules and forms. In addition, the disclosure controls and procedures ensure that information required to be disclosed is accumulated and communicated to management, including the CEO and CFO, allowing timely decisions regarding required disclosure.","context":"Disclosure Controls and Procedures","section":"Segment information and reconciliations to Xcel Energy’s consolidated operating revenues and net income:","block":1802,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000072903-26-000009","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-25","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0000072903","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/72903/000007290326000009/xel-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558.bin","sha256":"15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558"}},{"id":"eccc8ab5de65e94f1eaefffab73131c3366d0da772030cd0a5fe028ec2dca7aa","quote":"As of Dec. 31, 2025, based on an evaluation carried out under the supervision and with the participation of Xcel Energy’s management, including the CEO and CFO, of the effectiveness of its disclosure controls and procedures, the CEO and CFO have concluded that Xcel Energy’s disclosure controls and procedures were effective.","context":"Xcel Energy maintains a set of disclosure controls and procedures designed to ensure that information required to be disclosed in reports that it files or submits under the Securities Exchange Act of 1934 is recorded, processed, summarized, and reported within the time periods specified in SEC rules and forms. In addition, the disclosure controls and procedures ensure that information required to be disclosed is accumulated and communicated to management, including the CEO and CFO, allowing timely decisions regarding required disclosure.","section":"Segment information and reconciliations to Xcel Energy’s consolidated operating revenues and net income:","block":1803,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000072903-26-000009","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-25","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0000072903","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/72903/000007290326000009/xel-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558.bin","sha256":"15386a65d56ac573e94975738f070b69b8abc971ec1051e37593c49e44b14558"}},{"id":"26d978f769cf1796700a018d79516346f0827d5d15f8a5b3f27bc92281ee5c0e","quote":"No changes in Xcel Energy’s internal control over financial reporting occurred during the most recent fiscal quarter ended Dec. 31, 2025 that materially affected, or are reasonably likely to materially affect, Xcel Energy’s internal control over financial reporting. Xcel Energy maintains internal control over financial reporting to provide reasonable assurance regarding the reliability of the financial reporting. Xcel Energy has evaluated and documented its controls in process activities, general computer activities, and on an entity-wide level.","context":"Internal Control Over Financial Reporting","section":"Segment information and reconciliations to Xcel Energy’s consolidated operating revenues and net income:","block":1805,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000072903-26-000009","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-25","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0000072903","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/72903/000007290326000009/xel-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/15386a65d56ac573e94975